+# exp-app
+
+## Run locally
+
+### Backend
+
+```sh
+cd backend
+npm install
+npm start
+```
+
+The API listens on `PORT` (defaults to `3001`).
+
+### Frontend
+
+```sh
+cd frontend
+npm install
+npm run dev
+```
+
+The Vite dev server proxies `/api/*` to `http://localhost:3001` by default (override with `VITE_BACKEND_TARGET`).
+
